d them as it was able to  give them the numbers that they asked  for test 14 procedure asked if SCP  thirty-nine 73 could understand what the  doctors were saying with that to side  for yes and the three side for no  results the dye landed with the two  sides facing up analysis the possibility  of sapience in SCP 39 73 is considered  test 15  procedure asked of SCP 39 73 was aware  of what was going on around it results  the dye landed with the two side facing  up test 16 procedure asked if SCP 39 73  had thoughts results the dye landed with  the two side facing up note in the  months that SCP 39 73 has been in  foundation custody it has been kept in a  box in a locked anomalous item  containment locker now we are faced with  the possibility of sapiens  dr. harpy through testing it was  revealed that SCP 39 73 exhibits signs  of sapiens a communication system has  been established with SCP 39 73 the  object must be placed on a surface that  has a radius less than 50 centimeters  the interviewer can then roll a 20-sided  and six-sided die SCP 39 73 will make  the dice show a number that lines up  with the letter of the alphabet  if the letter is on a spot in the  alphabet lower than 20 SCP 39 73 will  make the six-sided die fall off the  table all dice falling off the table  indicates a period interview 39 73 1  interviewed SCP 39 73 interviewer dr.  harpy forward dr. harpy performed the  interview with the Afra mentioned  dice-based communication system and for  entertainment value SCP 39 73 has been  given a voice by my AI acid playing log  now what's the first thing that you can  remember is CP 39 73 where is commander  commander can you elaborate commander  took me in squadron pulled us together  made us we are today  others there are more like you others  but not like me look the same but no  brains still nice to be around what's  the last thing that you can remember  before being put into our custody  commander was upset not sure why was  helping commander win 